plaintext
* NMOS and PMOS definition
.model nmos nmos
.model pmos pmos

* Transistors
M1 2 1 3 3 nmos
M2 22 2 3 3 nmos
M3 5 5 3 3 pmos
M4 5 6 2 2 pmos
M5 2 2 2 2 pmos
M1A 3 3 2 2 nmos
M2A 3 6 2 2 nmos
M3A 5 3 2 2 pmos
M4A 5 6 2 2 pmos
M11 3 3 4 4 nmos
M12 3 3 4 4 nmos

* Voltage Sources
VDD 2 0 DC 5
VSS 3 0 DC -5

* Node Voltage Labels
V11 1 0 DC 1.5
V12 2 5 DC 1.5
Vcm 3 3 DC 1.5
VBB1 5 0 DC 0
VBB2 6 0 DC 0

.end